        <li>Cove & accent lighting design</li>
        <li>Material-aware color tuning</li>
        <li>Art & landscape illumination</li>
        <li>Hospitality & commercial</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card fade-up" style="--card-accent:#55efc4">
